        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, at regional storage
Shares of production in US (29%) and imports from China (67%) and Asia and Pacific (4%).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, cadmium telluride, thin film; 
UUID: 5ecf1f00-a9ac-4407-ade3-02cdf7a801ca
Domestic production and imports of single-crystalline silicon panels installed in the APAC countries. Transport from different world regions to regional storage.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: None
Time period: Data refer to 2018
Production volume: na
Sampling: Survey among market intelligence companies 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5ecf1f00-a9ac-4407-ade3-02cdf7a801ca.xml</text>
